        "created_at": "2014-10-16T18:42:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The QR codes are generated from within the mii maker, it should be one of the options on the bottom screen when you boot it up. The &nbsp;QR code image is then saved to the sd card and you have to upload it. You can use the website in my first post, but it actually looks like the new system update added more image sharing options for the 3ds, so if you want to try one of those out and report back feel free.</p>",
